}

{
  "translated_term": "Digitale Geisteswissenschaften",
  "translation_rationale": "The term 'Digital Humanities' is a combination of English words, but it can be broken down into its components. 'Digital' remains the same in German and Bavarian (Kodifikation: bar). The second part, 'Humanities', translates to 'Geisteswissenschaften' in standard German, which also applies to Bavarian."
