  "translation_rationale": "In Awadhi, the word for 'humanities' is actually \"मानव शास्त्र\" (mānav shāstr), which I modified to match the original term. This translation maintains the nuance of \"shāstr\", which connotes a sense of study or knowledge, and accurately reflects the concept of Digital Humanities in Awadhi."
}

{
  "translated_term": "Humanidaes Digitales",
